{
  "id": "GEN.33",
  "number": "33",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Genesis 33",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob lifted up his eyes and looked, and behold, Esau was coming, and four hundred men with him. So he divided the children among Leah and Rachel and the two maids. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the maids with their children in front, then Leah with her children, and Rachel and Joseph last of all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He himself went on before them, bowing himself to the ground seven times, until he came near to his brother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Esau ran to meet him, and embraced him, and fell on his neck and kissed him, and they wept. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Esau raised his eyes and saw the women and children, he said, “Who are these with you?” Jacob said, “The children whom God has graciously given your servant.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the maids drew near, they and their children, and bowed down; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leah likewise and her children drew near and bowed down; and last Joseph and Rachel drew near, and they bowed down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau said, “What do you mean by all this company which I met?” Jacob answered, “To find favor in the sight of my lord.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Esau said, “I have enough, my brother; keep what you have for yourself.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacob said, “No, I pray you, if I have found favor in your sight, then accept my present from my hand; for truly to see your face is like seeing the face of God, with such favor have you received me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Accept, I pray you, my gift that is brought to you, because God has dealt graciously with me, and because I have enough.” Thus he urged him, and he took it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Esau said, “Let us journey on our way, and I will go before you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jacob said to him, “My lord knows that the children are frail, and that the flocks and herds giving suck are a care to me; and if they are overdriven for one day, all the flocks will die. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let my lord pass on before his servant, and I will lead on slowly, according to the pace of the cattle which are before me and according to the pace of the children, until I come to my lord in Seir.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Esau said, “Let me leave with you some of the men who are with me.” But he said, “What need is there? Let me find favor in the sight of my lord.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Esau returned that day on his way to Seir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jacob journeyed to Succoth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Booths",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and built himself a house, and made booths for his cattle; therefore the name of the place is called Succoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob came safely to the city of Shechem, which is in the land of Canaan, on his way from Paddan-aram; and he camped before the city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And from the sons of Hamor, Shechem's father, he bought for a hundred pieces of money",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "a hundred qesitah",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the piece of land on which he had pitched his tent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There he erected an altar and called it El-Elohe-Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "God, the God of Israel",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
